/**
 * Logo mark: a pineapple with a pine crown over a clay body, the same
 * colouring as the original badge. The body carries a diamond lattice.
 *
 * Two drawings of the same mark. `small` has a coarser lattice that holds
 * up at header size; `full` is for anything from about 64px up. The source
 * files, with reversed and icon versions, are in `brand/`.
 *
 * The viewBox is 124 by 204. Each drawing uses its own ids, so one of each
 * can sit on a page; do not render two of the same detail on one page.
 */
